  "text": "You are wearing a light pink striped t-shirt top with a soft, fluid cut that flows effortlessly, paired with wide-leg grey jeans for a relaxed silhouette. The outfit is anchored by a red feathered belt at the waist to highlight your defined shape, and finished with burgundy pointed-toe heels that add just enough elegance for the office. A brown leather tote sits casually in hand — roomy enough for your essentials but styled to keep you grounded. This ensemble brings together comfort and polish: the playful stripes and feathers give it warmth and personality, while the structured jeans and sleek shoes ensure you can move through your creative workday with ease.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the top in slightly at the front to let the belt sit flush against your waist — this accentuates your defined shape without feeling restrictive.",
    "Leave the tote swinging loosely from one arm; it balances the narrowness of the top and adds a grounded, effortless air to your look.",
    "Step out barefoot or slip into the burgundy heels when you leave the office — they’re meant for transitions, not all-day wear."
