      "n": "#15·09",
      "text": "This lightweight pink striped t-shirt top has a relaxed collar and vertical stripes that elongate your frame. The soft fabric drapes gently without clinging, giving you movement and comfort all day."
    },
    {
      "n": "#315·35",
      "text": "Your wide-leg grey jeans offer a modern silhouette with just enough stretch to move freely. Their clean lines balance the playful top while keeping your look polished for the office."
    },
    {
      "n": "#225·19",
      "text": "This red feathered belt is bold and textured — it draws attention to your waist and adds a touch of glamour without being over-the-top. It’s perfect for turning a casual outfit into something refined."
    },
    {
      "n": "#82·22",
      "text": "The brown pebbled leather tote is structured yet soft, with roomy space for your laptop and essentials. Its neutral tone pairs beautifully with both the pink top and burgundy shoes."
    },
    {
      "n": "#373·11",
      "text": "These burgundy pointed-toe pumps bring sophistication to your look with a sleek heel that’s comfortable enough for walking between meetings. Their deep hue complements the red belt and adds visual cohesion."
